msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "TetradUI is a skin add-on for Kodi media center"
msgstr "TetradUI je kožni dodatak za Kodi medijski centar"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "TetradUI is a skin add-on for Kodi media center. The aim with TetradUI is to create a fresh modern homage of the classic blades-style UI found in the original Xbox360 dashboard. Also seen in the works of Team Blackbolt and Jezz_X with projects MC360 and JX720 respectively. TetradUI is based on JX720 by Jezz_X.[CR]This add-on was created by Jezz_X and TeamUI."
msgstr "TetradUI je dodatak za Kodi media center. Cilj TetradUI-ja je stvoriti svježu modernu omaž klasičnom korisničkom interfejsu u stilu blade-a koji se nalazi u originalnoj Xbox360 kontrolnoj tabli. Također se vidi u radovima Team Blackbolt i Jezz_X sa projektima MC360 i JX720 respektivno. TetradUI je baziran na JX720 od Jezz_X.[CR]Ovaj dodatak su kreirali Jezz_X i TeamUI."

